tem-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"writechars\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Writechars</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">99</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.52<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">April 13, 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20120413233656&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Miniature_House_df3b73.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a miniature house.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 10.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">This trophy was awarded to honour the greatest architects in Tibia.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>You can only read the text if you stand within two squares of it.<br/>\nIt is obtainable in-game since Update 9.6.\n</p><p>Awarded to the winners of CipSoft's Dream House Contest (April 2012). Players who received one (in addition to a CM Token) are:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Acallahm</li>\n<li>Giankk</li>\n<li>Vidron Xelis</li>\n<li>Creepy</li>\n<li>Araguth</li>\n<li>Pablityzz</li>\n<li>Laena the Gifted</li>\n<li>Elais</li>\n<li>Agreon</li>\n<li>Masked Santo</li></ul>\n<p>There's a very small chance of obtaining it after completing any of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Warzones\">Warzones</a> in the <a href=\"#/quest/bigfoots-burden-quest\">Bigfoot's Burden Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/bigfoots-burden-quest\">Bigfoot's Burden Quest</a></li><li>CM Token</li><li>Valuables</li><li>Writable Items</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["bigfoots-burden-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"bigfoots-burden-quest","quest":"Bigfoot&#39;s Burden Quest","step":"9-2","n":67,"title":"Baús de recompensa dos bosses","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}